    "text": "#LATTICE 比利時．列日鬆餅",
    "languageCode": "zh-TW"
  },
  "editorialSummary": {
    "text": "Charming cafe doling out made-to-order Belgian-style waffles with unique glazes & toppings.",
    "languageCode": "en"
